Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:08.87,Narration,,0,0,0,,At this blood-darkened cross, Willard turns prayer into an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:13.77,Narration,,0,0,0,,The ritual binds Arvin to a fear he cannot yet understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:20.36,Narration,,0,0,0,,Years earlier, one crucified Marine gave Willard's faith its permanent shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:29.95,Narration,,0,0,0,,The sight turns survival itself into something cruel and unbearable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:50.27,Narration,,0,0,0,,Back home, Willard's silence lets his mother arrange the next chapter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:55.45,Narration,,0,0,0,,Helen enters before Willard has even settled back into civilian life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:01:01.38,Narration,,0,0,0,,Emma sees two wounded young people and mistakes proximity for providence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.92,Narration,,0,0,0,,Willard makes Arvin study the wreckage before explaining the lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.10,0:01:32.87,Narration,,0,0,0,,One ordinary afternoon ends the moment Charlotte cannot answer her son.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.90,0:01:40.43,Narration,,0,0,0,,The diagnosis leaves medicine managing pain while Willard searches beyond it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.70,0:01:46.10,Narration,,0,0,0,,Willard offers what Arvin loves most as payment for Charlotte's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:54.24,Narration,,0,0,0,,His promise comforts nobody because Arvin has seen what faith now demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.90,0:02:13.23,Narration,,0,0,0,,Helen reads Roy's spectacle as proof that her loneliness has ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.50,0:02:27.54,Narration,,0,0,0,,Roy stays beside Helen, expecting belief to undo what belief caused.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.10,0:02:40.60,Narration,,0,0,0,,A waiting camera makes this generous pickup feel carefully staged.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.90,0:02:47.36,Narration,,0,0,0,,Sandy keeps calling Roy's name while Carl quietly controls the route.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.70,0:02:53.62,Narration,,0,0,0,,Arvin protects Lenora with the exact timing his father taught him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:07.64,Narration,,0,0,0,,The birthday gift puts Willard's old weapon back into Arvin's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.80,0:03:15.24,Narration,,0,0,0,,A polished stranger arrives to lead the same church that raised Lenora.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.80,0:03:38.40,Narration,,0,0,0,,Lenora hears private attention as spiritual guidance, exactly as Preston intends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:49.24,Narration,,0,0,0,,Carl packages control as crude humor, keeping Sandy inside the performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.80,0:03:58.68,Narration,,0,0,0,,Bodecker questions his own sister with the patience of a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:10.68,Narration,,0,0,0,,Preston uses sacred language to make Lenora distrust her own memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.80,0:04:32.20,Narration,,0,0,0,,Even in mourning, the family asks the same faith for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.10,0:04:51.34,Narration,,0,0,0,,Arvin frames the confrontation around Lenora, refusing to let Preston redirect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:56.30,Narration,,0,0,0,,Only after being exposed does Preston start speaking like a peacemaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.10,0:05:02.41,Narration,,0,0,0,,Carl recognizes a lone traveler, while Sandy recognizes the broken rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.90,0:05:10.08,Narration,,0,0,0,,A double-homicide call sends Bodecker toward the county road.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.30,0:05:15.00,Narration,,0,0,0,,Two measured wounds tell Bodecker this was no random roadside panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:20.47,Narration,,0,0,0,,Arvin returns to Mitchell Flats because every road began on this hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:26.30,Narration,,0,0,0,,For once, Arvin remembers Willard's desperation before judging his violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:31.10,Narration,,0,0,0,,Bodecker's voice turns Arvin's childhood woods into a hunting ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.20,0:05:35.52,Narration,,0,0,0,,The sheriff controls the clearing with noise while Arvin stays hidden.
